comments.body:
ICU says it is locale-based and their constants start with 1 (`UCAL_SUNDAY`). So there is a difference between the first day of the week and the numbering scheme. 

What you suggested is actually what we do!

```cpp
	struct DayOfWeekOperator {
		template <class TR>
		static inline TR DayOfWeekFromISO(TR isodow) {
			// day of the week (Sunday = 0, Saturday = 6)
			// turn sunday into 0 by doing mod 7
			return isodow % 7;
		}

		template <class TA, class TR>
		static inline TR Operation(TA input) {
			return DayOfWeekFromISO(Date::ExtractISODayOfTheWeek(input));
		}
```
